8.9% in Mississippi\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Prevalence and 95% confidence interval (CI) of short sleep duration and regular bedtime were calculated\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Pairwise differences by sex, race/ethnicity, special health care needs status, overall health status, and regular bedtime were determined using t-tests.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Tests for linear trend were conducted for family income level and parent education level.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"Analyses accounted for weighting of the data and for the complex sampling design.\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"SAS-callable SUDAAN (version 11.0.3; RTI International) was used to conduct all analyses.\"}, {\"loc\": \"note\", \"q\": \"The absolute CI width is >20% or the relative CI width is >120% (1.2 times the estimate).\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"analytic_depth\", \"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}